{"sha": "c09eb65b5a492a693fdd6c783b794f123771c12c160b25db88816f82c4ee9ec1", "body": ["\\chapter{pH 与电导率滴定}\\label{ch:g12:ph-conductivity-titrations}", "", "一瓶葡萄酒醋的标签上写着“6 \\% 酸度”，", "即每 100 克醋中含 6 克乙酸。", "乙酸及其共轭碱都没有颜色，高锰酸钾在这里也派不上用场。", "但把 pH 计插入醋中，或者用一个测量导电能力的电导池，", "随着逐滴加入的碱跟踪反应进程，曲线的形状准确显示出滴定终点的位置。", "在实验台上花十分钟，", "标签就可以核对了。", "", "\\begin{recall}", "滴定、滴定终点与等当点体积", "（\\cref{ch:g11:titration}）；酸度常数（\\cref{ch:g12:ka-and-pka}）；", "亨德森关系式与指示剂", "（\\cref{ch:g12:buffers-predominance}）；离子溶液", "能导电（\\cref{ch:g9:ions}）。", "\\end{recall}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\includegraphics[width=0.45\\linewidth]{images/book1/ai/g12-wine-lab.jpg}", "", "{\\small 酿酒师的滴定实验台。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{pH 滴定}", "", "\\begin{definition}[pH 滴定、半等当点]\\label{def:g12:ph-conductivity-titrations:ph-metric}", "在\\emph{pH 滴定}\\index{pH 滴定}中，被滴定溶液的", "pH 在每次加入滴定剂后测定，并作出 pH 随所加体积变化的曲线。", "\\emph{半等当点}\\index{半等当点}是指", "已加入一半等当点体积时的那一点。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, scale=0.65]", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (0,0) {stand={6.3}{2.0}};", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (2.0,0.68) {stirrer};", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (2.0,0.68) {beaker={0.45}{omWater}};", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (2.0,2.9) {burette={0.8}{omWater}};", "  \\pic[transform shape] (pr) at (2.6,0.95) {probe};", "  \\pic[transform shape] (m) at (6.4,3.4) {meter={pH}};", "  \\draw[black!70, thick] (pr-top) .. controls +(0,1.0) and +(0,-1.2) .. (m-a);", "  \\draw[omProp, thick, <-] (2.35,7.2) -- (4.3,7.6) node[right, text=black] {滴定管：NaOH};", "  \\draw[omProp, thick, <-] (1.4,1.1) -- (-1.4,1.6) node[left, text=black, align=right] {待滴定的酸};", "  \\draw[omProp, thick, <-] (2.75,2.4) -- (4.3,2.0) node[right, text=black] {pH 探头};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small pH 滴定示意：探头浸入正在搅拌的溶液中，", "pH 计显示每次加入后的 pH。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{inthelab}[校准 pH 计]", "使用前，先用蒸馏水冲洗探头，再将其浸入两种", "pH 已知的缓冲溶液中（通常为 7.0 和 4.0，或 10.0），并将 pH 计", "调至显示这些溶液的标准值。两种溶液之间，探头需冲洗并", "轻轻吸干，切勿擦拭；保存时探头尖端保持湿润。", "\\end{inthelab}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{minipage}{0.49\\linewidth}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=\\linewidth, height=6cm, xmin=0, xmax=30, ymin=0, ymax=14,", "    xlabel={$V_{\\text{NaOH}}$ (\\si{mL})}, ylabel={pH}, axis lines*=left,", "    ymajorgrids, grid style={gray!20}, tick label style={font=\\scriptsize},", "    label style={font=\\small}, title={\\small \\ce{HCl}（用 \\ce{NaOH} 滴定）},", "    title style={yshift=-4pt}]", "  \\addplot[very thick, omDef] table[x=V, y=pH] {figdata/out/grade-12-ph-conductivity-titrations-a.dat};", "  \\addplot[thick, omProp, densely dotted] table[x=V, y expr=\\thisrow{dpH}/4]", "    {figdata/out/grade-12-ph-conductivity-titrations-a.dat};", "  \\addplot[dashed, black!60] coordinates {(20,0) (20,7)};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north west] at (axis cs:20.3,6.5) {$V_E = 20.0$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}{0.49\\linewidth}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=\\linewidth, height=6cm, xmin=0, xmax=16, ymin=0, ymax=14,", "    xlabel={$V_{\\text{NaOH}}$ (\\si{mL})}, ylabel={pH}, axis lines*=left,", "    ymajorgrids, grid style={gray!20}, tick label style={font=\\scriptsize},", "    label style={font=\\small}, title={\\small \\ce{CH3COOH}（用 \\ce{NaOH} 滴定）},", "    title style={yshift=-4pt}]", "  \\addplot[very thick, omDef] table[x=V, y=pH] {figdata/out/grade-12-ph-conductivity-titrations-b.dat};", "  \\addplot[thick, omProp, densely dotted] table[x=V, y expr=\\thisrow{dpH}/4]", "    {figdata/out/grade-12-ph-conductivity-titrations-b.dat};", "  \\addplot[dashed, black!60] coordinates {(10.1,0) (10.1,8.7)};", "  \\addplot[dashed, black!60] coordinates {(0,4.76) (5.05,4.76) (5.05,0)};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=south west] at (axis cs:0.2,4.8) {$pK_a = 4.76$};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north west] at (axis cs:10.4,3.0) {$V_E = 10.1$};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\end{minipage}", "", "{\\small 计算得到的 pH 曲线（蓝色）及其导数 $d\\mathrm{pH}/dV$", "（橙色，点线，已除以 4）。左图：\\qty{20.0}{mL} 盐酸，", "浓度为 \\qty{0.100}{mol/L}；滴定终点位于 pH 7.00。右图：\\qty{10.0}{mL}", "稀释醋；在半等当点处 pH 等于 $pK_a$，而", "滴定终点位于碱性 pH 处。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "", "\\begin{method}[导数法]\\label{met:g12:ph-conductivity-titrations:derivative}", "在相邻两次测量之间计算斜率", "$\\Delta\\mathrm{pH}/\\Delta V$，并对 $V$ 作图（可用电子表格或", "计算器完成）。等当点体积即斜率最大处，", "也就是导数曲线的峰值。", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{method}[切线法]\\label{met:g12:ph-conductivity-titrations:tangent}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 在曲线上作两条平行切线，一条位于跃变之前，", "        一条位于跃变之后，分居跃变两侧。", "  \\item 作出位于两切线中间的平行线。", "  \\item 该平行线与曲线的交点即为滴定终点，读出 $V_E$（及", "        滴定终点处的 pH）。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", ""]}